---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="2026 按量不限时机场推荐 - 备用/轻度翻墙/ChatGPT首选"
	description="极度轻量级用户必备！老叶为您筛选支持按量付费、不限时不失效的备用机场。只买几 G 流量，用到天荒地老，是偶尔查资料、用 ChatGPT 用户的省钱首选。"
>
	<main class="flex-1">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50/70 via-slate-50 to-slate-50 min-h-[60vh] flex items-center">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full py-16">
				<div class="max-w-3xl">
					<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-50/80 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-700 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-emerald-500/20 backdrop-blur-sm">
						⏳ 永不过期、极轻度适用
					</span>
					
					<h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
						2026 按量付费/极小体验包精选
					</h1>
					
					<p class="mt-6 text-base leading-loose text-slate-700 sm:text-lg bg-white/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm relative">
						<span class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 text-4xl">💬</span>
						<strong>老叶说句实在话：</strong>如果你平时根本不看油管，只是偶尔需要用一下 Google 查个文献，或者每天跟 ChatGPT 聊几句，那你去买包月套餐纯粹是给机场主送钱。<br><br>
						这个时候，你需要的是一个“只要你不把流量用完，它就永远不过期”的【按量不限时包】，或者几十块钱就能买一大堆流量的极低频备用套餐。这种套餐虽然单价看起来稍贵，但因为没有月租，算下来一年能省好几百。下面这两家，是极少数愿意拉下身段卖这种低利润套餐的良心厂家。
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- 机场排行榜专区 -->
		<section id="rankings" class="py-12 bg-white relative scroll-mt-12">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				
				<!-- 分类筛选导航 (按量分类激活) -->
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-12">
					<a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900 transition-all">🔥 综合 Top 精选</a>
					<a href="/iplc/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900 transition-all">👑 IPLC 顶级专线</a>
					<a href="/iepl/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900 transition-all">💎 IEPL 稳定专线</a>
					<a href="/cheap/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-inset ring-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900 transition-all">💰 便宜高性价比</a>
					<a href="/pay-as-you-go/" class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-all">⏳ 按量不限时包</a>
				</div>

				<div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] lg:gap-10 items-start max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					
					<!-- 左侧：机场卡片列表 -->
					<div class="space-y-6">
					
					<!-- Top 1: 闪跃机场 -->
					<div id="top-1" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl shadow-amber-100/50 ring-2 ring-amber-400 transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-200/50 scroll-mt-24">
						<div class="absolute -right-12 -top-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-amber-100/50 group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-700"></div>
						<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 rounded-bl-3xl bg-amber-500 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md">
							👑 顶级专线 体验包
						</div>
						
						<div class="relative z-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
							<div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
									<h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">闪跃</h3>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
									<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">⚡ IPLC 专线</span>
									<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">极简备用包</span>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-6">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-3">
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>速度: 9.7</span>
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>稳定: 9.8</span>
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>性价比: 9.9</span>
									</div>
									<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
										<div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 p-3 border border-emerald-100">
											<h4 class="font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>老叶点评</h4>
											<ul class="text-emerald-700 space-y-1 text-xs">
												<li>• 闪跃提供了一个极小金额的“体验包”，非常适合作为不常用用户的备用。用顶级的 IPLC 线路做备用，遇到主机场出问题时，切过来犹如神助。</li>
											</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								
							</div>
							
							<div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:items-end justify-center border-t border-slate-100 pt-6 sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l sm:pl-6 sm:pt-0">
								<div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
									<span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600">极低门槛</span>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full">
									<span class="inline-flex justify-between rounded bg-slate-100 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600"><span>极小体验包</span><span>(前往官网查看)</span></span>
								</div>

								<a href="https://koolykh88.flashleapaff.com/#/?code=6kHcdCND" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="mt-4 w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
									前往官网查阅按量包
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Top 2: 跨界云 -->
					<div id="top-2" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md ring-1 ring-slate-200 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:ring-slate-300 scroll-mt-24">
						<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 rounded-bl-3xl bg-slate-200 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 shadow-sm">
							🥈 过渡备用 首选
						</div>
						
						<div class="relative z-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
							<div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
									<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">跨界云</h3>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
									<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 border border-slate-200">轻度用户适用</span>
									<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 border border-slate-200">10元过渡套餐</span>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-6">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-3">
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>速度: 7.5</span>
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>稳定: 8.0</span>
										<span class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>性价比: 9.6</span>
									</div>
									<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
										<div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 p-3 border border-emerald-100">
											<h4 class="font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>老叶点评</h4>
											<ul class="text-emerald-700 space-y-1 text-xs">
												<li>• 提供了极其便宜的 10 元左右的过渡套餐。由于本来就是走轻度路线，即使不买不限时包，当做临时应急也毫无压力。</li>
											</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
							
							<div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:items-end justify-center border-t border-slate-100 pt-6 sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l sm:pl-6 sm:pt-0">
								<div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
									<span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">¥10</span>
									<span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">/月起</span>
								</div>
								
								<div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full">
									<span class="inline-flex justify-between rounded bg-slate-100 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600"><span>过渡套餐</span><span>约 ¥10.0</span></span>
								</div>

								<a href="https://koolykh88.kuajieaff.com/#/?code=UWUfGLwJ" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="mt-4 w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
									前往官网购买
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					</div>

					<!-- 右侧：电梯导航侧边栏 -->
					<div class="hidden lg:block sticky top-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
						<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
							<svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"/></svg>
							轻量/备用导航
						</h3>
						<nav class="space-y-3">
							<a href="#top-1" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">🏆 闪跃 (有体验包)</a>
							<a href="#top-2" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">🥈 跨界云 (低价过渡)</a>
							<div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
								<a href="#faq" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">❓ 备用机场避坑</a>
							</div>
						</nav>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAQ 防骗指南 -->
		<section id="faq" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 scroll-mt-10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-center mb-12">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">买备用机场/按量包的注意事项</h2>
					<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">不要因为便宜就乱买，备用的核心是“关键时刻不能掉链子”。</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<details class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 open:ring-emerald-500 open:shadow-md transition-all">
						<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-bold text-slate-900 outline-none hover:text-emerald-600">
							<span>怎么判断一个不限时套餐是不是坑？</span>
							<span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-emerald-500">
								<svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
							</span>
						</summary>
						<div class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
							<p>很多野鸡机场卖很便宜的“按量包”，但等你主机场挂了，切到它身上的时候，你发现它也挂了。这是因为它们用了同样便宜且不稳定的中转线路。</p>
							<p class="mt-2">最好的备用机场，其线路质量必须过硬（至少得是专线）。比如用闪跃的 IPLC 来做备用，一旦你的主机场遭遇断网，闪跃不仅能连上，还能跑满带宽，这才是有效备用。</p>
						</div>
					</details>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
